+# Let OpenSSL and the linker produce the suffixed filenames, SONAMEs, dependency
+# names and version tables together. Post-link patchelf rewriting produced a
+# PT_LOAD whose file offset and virtual address were not page-congruent; Android
+# then mapped .dynstr incorrectly and aborted before the application's main().
+cat > Configurations/99-aspia-android.conf <<'OPENSSL_TARGET'
